        "content": "<p>myunbin opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14296\">PR #14296</a> from <code>myunbin:add-rules-260908</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Add new opt rules:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>x /u (1 &lt;&lt; y) ==&gt; x &gt;&gt;u y</code></li>\n<li><code>(x ^ y) ^ (x ^ z) ==&gt; y ^ z</code></li>\n<li><code>(-x) &amp; 1 ==&gt; x &amp; 1</code></li>\n<li><code>(x &gt;&gt;s y) &gt;s -1 ==&gt; x &gt;=s 0</code></li>\n<li><code>(x &gt;&gt;s y) &gt;=s 0 ==&gt; x &gt;=s 0</code></li>\n<li><code>(x &amp; y) &amp; (x | z) ==&gt; x &amp; y</code></li>\n<li><code>(x &amp; y) | (x | z) ==&gt; x | z</code></li>\n<li><code>(x &amp; y) | (x ^ y) ==&gt; x | y</code></li>\n<li><code>~((~x) - y) ==&gt; x + y</code></li>\n<li><code>rotl(x, k) == rotl(y, k) ==&gt; x == y</code></li>\n<li><code>~((~x) &gt;&gt;s y) ==&gt; x &gt;&gt;s y</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Apply <code>all_zero</code> helper to existing zero-constant rules in:</p>\n<p>{arithmetic, bitops, cprop, extends, icmp, selects, shifts}.isle</p>\n</blockquote>",
